msgstr ""
"Anda tidak dapat memindahkan apa pun yang Anda ambil gambarnya saat perintah"
" dump frame sedang berjalan"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/cmucam4-graphical-user-interface.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Opacity Control** - Select the sent frame and sent bitmap opacity - "
"between 1.00 for 100% and 0.00 for 0%"
msgstr ""
"**Opacity Control** - Pilih opasitas frame terkirim dan bitmap terkirim - "
"antara 1.00 untuk 100% dan 0.00 untuk 0%"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/cmucam4-graphical-user-interface.rst:161
msgid ""
"**Tracking Control** - Select a color blob in the viewing window to track"
msgstr ""
"**Tracking Control** - Pilih blob warna di jendela tampilan untuk dilacak"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/cmucam4-graphical-user-interface.rst:163
msgid ""
"The selection rectangle should only enclose the pixels within the color blob"
" you want to track"
msgstr ""
"Persegi panjang seleksi hanya boleh melingkupi piksel di dalam blob warna "
"yang ingin Anda lacak"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/cmucam4-graphical-user-interface.rst:165
msgid ""
"After selecting the color blob click the track color button to compute the "
"color bounds to track that color blob"
msgstr ""
"Setelah memilih blob warna, klik tombol track color untuk menghitung batas "
"warna guna melacak blob warna tersebut"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/cmucam4-graphical-user-interface.rst:168
msgid ""
"The algorithm works by computing the mean and standard deviation of the red,"
" green, and blue color channels inside of the selection rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma bekerja dengan menghitung rata-rata dan standar deviasi dari "
"channel warna merah, hijau, dan biru di dalam persegi panjang seleksi"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/cmucam4-graphical-user-interface.rst:170
msgid ""
"The Confidence Interval Level Coefficient selects how much of the standard "
"deviation to add +/- to the means of the red, green, and blue color channels"
" - between 0 for +/- (stdev * 1) to 99 for +/- (stdev * 10)"
msgstr ""
"Confidence Interval Level Coefficient memilih seberapa banyak standar "
"deviasi yang ditambahkan +/- ke rata-rata channel warna merah, hijau, dan "
"biru - antara 0 untuk +/- (stdev * 1) hingga 99 untuk +/- (stdev * 10)"

